/	JMS I	(CALCUL)	/CALCULATE AVERAGE,MAX &MIN
/	JMS I	(AVRCAL)	/DO FLOATING AVERAGE
/	JMS I	(VARCAL)	/CALCULATE VARIANCE
/	JMS I	(TMCNST)	/CALCULATE TIME CONSTANT
/	JMP I	FRQAN		/RETURN
