TSWITCH,.-.			/SWITCH TO USE KEYBOARD

CHKUP,	.-.			/CHECK FOR <^P>, <^C>, ETC.
	JMS	CTLCTST		/TEST FOR <^C>, ETC.
	SZA			/SKIP IF NOTHING THERE
	TAD	(-"Q!300)	/ELSE COMPARE TO <^Q>
