	JMP	P7AGN		/CHECK INPUT WHILE WAITING
	JMS	CHKUP		/CHECK FOR <^C>, ETC.
	JMP I	P7CH		/RETURN

/OUTPUTS A CHARACTER

P7OUT,	.-.			/SEVEN BIT I/O ROUTINE
